  "54": {
    "inputs": {
      "text": "This is a dynamic, stylized photograph capturing a woman in the middle of an athletic movement within a modern living room.\n\n**Color Palette:**\nThe scene is bathed in dramatic, cool-toned lighting that creates a high-contrast, almost cinematic atmosphere. The dominant colors are:\n*   **Cyan and Blue:** A strong, vibrant cyan light illuminates the subject from the side, casting an intense glow on her raised leg, foot, torso, and face.\n*   **Magenta and Purple:** Complementary magenta and purple hues wash over other areas of the image, particularly the couch, the wall behind it, and parts of her skin and clothing. This creates a striking color contrast.\n*   **Neutral Tones:** The background elements—a plain white wall, a light gray sofa with wooden legs, and the black fan—are rendered in neutral tones that are vividly colored by the lighting.\n\n**Objects:**\nThe main subject is a young woman with dark hair tied up in a bun. She is dressed in athletic attire: a simple white t-shirt and black shorts.\n*   Her right leg is extended high into a powerful, controlled kick, her foot pointing upwards towards the ceiling.\n*   Her left arm is bent, holding a tight fist near her chest.\n*   In the background to the right stands a large, black pedestal fan, its blades visible.\n*   A modern, minimalist gray sofa occupies the lower portion of the frame.\n\n**Composition:**\nThe composition is dynamic and centered on the woman's powerful pose. She is positioned slightly off-center, creating an energetic flow in the image as her leg sweeps upwards and outwards. The camera angle appears to be at eye level with her, capturing her intense expression and full-body movement. The background elements—the sofa and fan—act as simple anchors that ground the scene without distracting from the subject.\n\n**Mood:**\nThe mood is one of intense focus, power, and athleticism. Her facial expression—wide eyes, slightly open mouth—is one of concentration and exertion. The vibrant, contrasting lighting elevates this moment into something almost surreal or artistic, transforming a mundane living room setting into a stage for raw physical strength and discipline. It conveys a sense of personal empowerment and the fusion of domestic space with intense physical training.\n\nThe overall effect is energetic, dramatic, and visually arresting, suggesting a blend of athleticism, creativity, and modern lifestyle."
    },
    "class_type": "CLIPTextEncode",
    "_meta": {
      "title": "CLIP Text Encode (Positive Prompt)"
    }
  },
